1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,281
Make the bar yours.

2
00:00:01,321 --> 00:00:03,560
Presets, size, shape,
colour and where it sits.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,256
Open Appearance.

4
00:00:05,296 --> 00:00:07,372
In Gesture Volume, tap Appearance.

5
00:00:07,412 --> 00:00:10,360
The preview at the top
shows the bar on a phone.

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,528
Start from a preset.

7
00:00:12,568 --> 00:00:19,160
Quick presets set the whole look at
once: Classic, Dock, Edge and Bold.

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,805
Size and shape.

9
00:00:20,845 --> 00:00:24,752
Open Size & shape and
drag Width and Height.

10
00:00:24,792 --> 00:00:28,160
Rounded or Tab sets how the ends look.

11
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,830
Pick a colour.

12
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:34,135
Under Colours, tap Fill
and choose a colour.

13
00:00:34,175 --> 00:00:37,560
The preview takes it straight away.

14
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,938
Choose a side.

15
00:00:38,978 --> 00:00:42,634
Under Position, put it
on the left or the right,

16
00:00:42,674 --> 00:00:45,560
and set how far down the edge it sits.

17
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,756
Save it. Tap Save.

18
00:00:47,796 --> 00:00:53,760
Go home, and your bar is on
the edge just as you made it.

19
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:59,110
Up next: Keep it out of the way.
